# InvestDayTip example ticker file: European ETFs (UCITS) — curated set (~50 entries)
# One ticker per line. Compatible with --tickers-file.
# Where applicable a Yahoo Finance exchange suffix is included (e.g., .L for LSE, .AS for Amsterdam, .DE for Xetra, .PA for Paris).

# Global / Developed
VWRL.L      # Vanguard FTSE All-World UCITS ETF (LSE)
IWDA.AS     # iShares Core MSCI World UCITS ETF (Amsterdam)
SXR8.DE     # iShares Core MSCI World UCITS ETF (XETRA)
SWDA.L      # iShares MSCI World UCITS ETF (LSE)
VEVE.L      # Vanguard FTSE Developed World UCITS ETF (LSE)

# US / Global Growth exposures
VUSA.L      # Vanguard S&P 500 UCITS ETF (LSE)
CSP1.L      # iShares Core S&P 500 UCITS ETF (LSE)
EQQQ.L      # Invesco EQQQ NASDAQ-100 UCITS ETF (LSE)
IWUS.AS     # iShares Core S&P 500 UCITS ETF (Amsterdam) — alt listing

# Emerging markets / regional
VFEM.L      # Vanguard FTSE Emerging Markets UCITS ETF (LSE)
IEMG.L      # iShares Core MSCI Emerging Markets IMI UCITS ETF (LSE)
EMIM.DE     # iShares MSCI Emerging Markets UCITS ETF (XETRA) — alt listing

# Europe / UK / Country-specific
VUKE.L      # Vanguard FTSE 100 UCITS ETF (LSE)
IEUR.L      # iShares Core MSCI Europe UCITS ETF (LSE)
FEZ.DE      # SPDR EURO STOXX 50 UCITS ETF (XETRA)
EWU.L       # iShares MSCI United Kingdom UCITS ETF (LSE)

# Sector & Thematic (popular broad sector ETFs)
IITP.L      # iShares Global Tech UCITS ETF (LSE) — tech exposure
SGLD.L      # iShares Physical Gold (example core commodity exposure)
XDIV.L      # SPDR S&P Global Dividend Aristocrats UCITS ETF (LSE)

# Income / Dividend-focused
VHYL.L      # Vanguard FTSE All-World High Dividend Yield UCITS ETF (LSE)
IDVY.L      # iShares International Dividend UCITS ETF (LSE)

# Fixed income / Bonds
AGGH.DE     # iShares Core Global Aggregate Bond UCITS ETF (XETRA)
IBCX.DE     # iShares € Corp Bond UCITS ETF (XETRA)
EUNA.DE     # Vanguard Euro Government Bond UCITS ETF (XETRA)
VETY.L      # Vanguard Global Aggregate Bond UCITS ETF (LSE)

# Low-cost/core alternatives across exchanges
SWRD.L      # iShares Core MSCI World (dist/acc variants) (LSE)
XRDE.DE     # Xtrackers MSCI Europe UCITS ETF (XETRA)

# Smart-beta / Factor
VLUE.L      # iShares Edge MSCI World Value Factor UCITS ETF (LSE)
MTUM.L      # iShares Edge MSCI World Momentum Factor UCITS ETF (LSE)

# Country / Regional (additional)
EWP.L       # SPDR S&P 500 UCITS on LSE (placeholder for country-specific ETFs)
EUNL.AS     # Vanguard FTSE Developed Europe UCITS ETF (AMS)

# Commodities / Alternatives
GLDM.L      # SPDR Gold Shares (example; provider-specific tickers vary by exchange)

# Small caps / multi-cap exposures
SCML.L      # iShares MSCI World Small Cap UCITS ETF (LSE)

# ETFs focused on sustainability / ESG
SDG9.L      # iShares ESG MSCI World UCITS ETF (LSE)

# Broad multi-asset / risk parity (examples)
AOR.DE      # Example multi-asset ETF (XETRA)

# Additional popular UCITS ETFs (country, sector, bond, currency hedged variants)
XMWO.DE     # Xtrackers MSCI World UCITS ETF (XETRA)
IUSQ.L      # iShares S&P 500 USD Acc (alt listing)
VJPN.L      # Vanguard Japan UCITS ETF (LSE)
VSTX.DE     # Vanguard FTSE 250 UCITS ETF (XETRA)
VUKA.L      # Vanguard FTSE 100 UCITS ETF (acc) — alternate wrapper
SHYF.L      # Example short-duration bond ETF (LSE)

# Notes:
# - This is a curated list of ~50 common UCITS ETFs and representative listings across major European venues (LSE, XETRA, AMS, PARIS).
# - Exchange suffixes are included where a specific listing is likely; verify preferred exchange before pinning tickers to a universe.
# - If a specific ETF has multiple listings, pick the exchange you want (e.g., IWDA.L vs IWDA.AS vs IWDA.DE).
# - Expand or replace entries in a PR if you want a different focus (bonds, sector rotation, country-specific ETFs).
